sequenceDiagram
 actor Caller
 participant App as Application service
 participant Store as SQLite write owner
 participant Sup as Agent supervisor
 participant Target as Provider or tool

 Note over Caller,Store: Case 1 - concurrent Start requests for one work root
 Caller->>App: Start command A
 Caller->>App: Start command B
 App->>Store: Validate and commit activation X, history, receipt, intent
 Store-->>App: Accepted X
 App->>Store: Validate second command against current activation
 Store-->>App: Existing activation X
 App-->>Caller: Same activation reference

 Note over App,Target: Case 2 - Pause ordered against dispatch admission
 alt Pause commits first
  App->>Store: Persist pause and advance control revision
  Sup->>Store: Claim or admit dispatch using old revision
  Store-->>Sup: Held or superseded
  Note over Sup,Target: No new provider request or tool effect
 else Dispatch admission commits first
  Sup->>Store: Record fenced effect attempt as admitted
  Sup->>Target: Begin owned request
  App->>Store: Persist pause and advance control revision
  Store-->>Sup: Block further admissions
  Sup->>Target: Request cancellation where supported
  Note over Store,Target: Observe outcome or retain uncertainty before retry
 end

 Note over App,Sup: Case 3 - app crash after activation commit, before launch
 App->>Store: Commit activation Y, history, receipt, intent
 Note over App,Sup: App process exits before supervisor launch
 App->>Store: Reopen and inspect interrupted activations
 Store-->>App: Y retained with manual-resume hold
 App-->>Caller: Await explicit Continue
 Caller->>App: Authorized Continue
 App->>Store: Revalidate, fence old intent and commit new attempt
 Store-->>Sup: Claimable committed activation
 Sup->>Store: Claim lease and recheck current eligibility
 Note over Sup,Target: Execution only under current ownership and controls
